,"type":"topic"},"doc://AstronomyKit/documentation/AstronomyKit":{"url":"\/documentation\/astronomykit","identifier":"doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit","abstract":[{"text":"Swift bindings for Don Cross’ ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/cosinekitty\/astronomy","isActive":true},{"text":" library.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"AstronomyKit","kind":"symbol"},"doc://AstronomyKit/documentation/AstronomyKit/Observer":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Observer","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Observer","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Observer","identifier":"doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/Observer","url":"\/documentation\/astronomykit\/observer","abstract":[{"text":"A geographic location for observing celestial objects.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}